  1906                              <1> ; =============================================================================
  1907                              <1> ;  The imports: kernel32.dll only. An import directory entry, the import
  1908                              <1> ;  lookup table, the hint/name entries and the DLL's name; then the import
  1909                              <1> ;  address table, which the loader fills in, right below `next`, so that
  1910                              <1> ;  CALL [EBP+d8] reaches it.
  1911                              <1> ; =============================================================================
  1912                              <1> %macro  IMPORTS 1
  1913                              <1>         IMP     GetStdHandle
  1914                              <1>         IMP     GetConsoleMode
  1915                              <1>         IMP     SetConsoleMode
  1916                              <1>         IMP     GetCommandLineA
