  1935 000005C0 [1407C0FF]          <1>         dd      dllname-IB              ; Name
  1936 000005C4 [2407C0FF]          <1>         dd      iat-IB                  ; FirstThunk: the IAT
  1937 000005C8 00<rep 14h>         <1>         times   20 db 0                 ; the null entry that ends the list
